@startuml UC-14-Manajemen-XP-Ranked
title Sequence Diagram: Manajemen XP dan Ranked (Admin)

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Dashboard Admin\nHalaman XP & Ranked\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/admin/xp-config\nPUT /api/admin/xp-config\nPOST /api/admin/season/reset\nPOST /api/admin/xp/recalculate" as API
participant "XPManagementController" as Controller
participant "XPManagementService\nNotificationService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel SystemConfig,\nConfigChangeLog,\nPengguna, RiwayatBelajar,\nSeason, SeasonWinners)" as DB

== Flow Normal - Ubah Bobot XP ==

Admin -> UI: Mengakses menu\n"Manajemen XP & Ranked"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/xp-config
activate API
API -> Controller: getCurrentConfig()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getConfig()
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM SystemConfig\nWHERE config_type = 'xp_settings'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return konfigurasi XP saat ini
deactivate DB
Service -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*), AVG(totalXP),\nMAX(totalXP) FROM Pengguna\n(statistik leaderboard)
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return statistik
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nconfig: {...}, stats: {...} }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data konfigurasi dan statistik
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Menampilkan dashboard dengan\nkonfigurasi XP saat ini\ndan statistik leaderboard
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan form parameter:\nXP per baca materi, XP per kuis,\nXP per upload, XP per buat kuis
Admin -> UI: Pilih "Ubah Bobot XP"
Admin -> UI: Sesuaikan nilai parameter\n(misal: 10 → 15)
Admin -> UI: Klik "Preview Impact"
UI -> UI: Kalkulasi simulasi dampak
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan estimasi dampak\n"Rata-rata XP naik 20%"
Admin -> UI: Klik "Simpan Konfigurasi"

alt Parameter valid (0-1000)
    UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/xp-config\n{ xp_read_materi: 15,\nxp_complete_quiz: 50,\nxp_upload_materi: 20,\nxp_create_quiz: 30 }
    activate API
    API -> Controller: updateConfig()
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: updateXPConfig(newConfig, adminId)
    activate Service
    Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM SystemConfig\nWHERE config_type = 'xp_settings'\n(get old values)
    DB --> Service: Return old config
    Service -> DB: UPDATE SystemConfig SET\nconfig_value = '[newConfig]',\nupdated_at = NOW(),\nupdated_by = '[adminId]'\nWHERE config_type = 'xp_settings'
    DB --> Service: UPDATE success
    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO ConfigChangeLog\n(admin_id, parameter_changed,\nold_value, new_value, timestamp)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', 'xp_read_materi',\n10, 15, NOW())
    DB --> Service: Log saved
    Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB --> Service: Transaction committed
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller: { success: true }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Response sukses
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Konfigurasi XP berhasil\ndiperbarui"
    UI -> UI: Refresh dashboard
else Parameter tidak valid
    UI --> Admin: Tampilkan error\n"Nilai XP harus 0-1000"
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow A - Reset Season ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih "Reset Peringkat\n(Season Baru)"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/season/current
activate API
API -> Controller: getCurrentSeason()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getSeasonInfo()
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Season\nWHERE status = 'active'\nORDER BY start_date DESC\nLIMIT 1
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return info season aktif
deactivate DB
Service -> DB: SELECT idAkun, namaLengkap,\ntotalXP, rankPeringkat\nFROM Pengguna\nORDER BY totalXP DESC\nLIMIT 10
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return top 10 winners
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { season: {...},\ntopWinners: [...] }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Info season
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan info season\n(start date, top winners)
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan peringatan\n"Reset akan mengarsipkan\npemenang dan reset XP ke 0"
Admin -> UI: Isi nama season baru\n"Season 2 - August 2026"
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Mulai Season Baru"
UI -> API: POST /api/admin/season/reset\n{ newSeasonName: "..." }
activate API
API -> Controller: resetSeason()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: startNewSeason(seasonName, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE Season SET\nstatus = 'ended',\nend_date = NOW()\nWHERE status = 'active'
DB --> Service: Old season closed
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO SeasonWinners\nSELECT idAkun, namaLengkap,\ntotalXP, xpLearner, xpCreator,\nrankPeringkat, '[seasonName]',\nNOW() as end_date\nFROM Pengguna\nWHERE totalXP > 0\nORDER BY totalXP DESC
DB --> Service: Winners archived
Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\ntotalXP = 0, xpLearner = 0,\nxpCreator = 0,\nrankPeringkat = 'Unranked'
DB --> Service: All XP reset
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Season\n(season_name, start_date, status)\nVALUES ('[newSeasonName]', NOW(),\n'active')
DB --> Service: New season created
Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> Service: Transaction committed
deactivate DB
Service ->> NotificationService: broadcastToAllUsers(\n'new_season', message)
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Season berhasil direset"
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow B - Rekalkulasi XP ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih "Rekalkulasi XP\nSemua Pengguna"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan warning\n"Proses lama, akan hitung\nulang dari RiwayatBelajar"
Admin -> UI: Klik "Mulai Rekalkulasi"
UI -> API: POST /api/admin/xp/recalculate
activate API
API -> Controller: recalculateAllXP()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: recalculateXPForAllUsers(adminId)
activate Service
Service ->> BackgroundJob: Start background job
Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nmessage: "Rekalkulasi dimulai",\njobId: "..." }
Controller --> API: Response 202 Accepted
API --> UI: Response job started
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan progress bar\n"Rekalkulasi dimulai..."

note over Service, DB
  Background Job Process:
  1. SELECT all user IDs
  2. Loop untuk setiap user:
     - SELECT SUM(xpDidapat)
       FROM RiwayatBelajar
       GROUP BY tipeKonten
     - Kalkulasi totalXP
     - UPDATE Pengguna SET
       xpLearner, xpCreator, totalXP
  3. Generate report
  4. Log ke ConfigChangeLog
end note

UI -> API: Poll GET /api/admin/xp/\nrecalculate/status\n(every 2 seconds)
activate API
API --> UI: { status: 'completed',\nupdated: X }
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Rekalkulasi selesai.\nX pengguna diupdate"
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow C - Atur Threshold Rank ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih "Kelola Rank Tiers"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/rank-tiers
activate API
API -> Controller: getRankTiers()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getRankConfig()
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM SystemConfig\nWHERE config_type = 'rank_thresholds'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return rank tiers\n(Bronze: 100, Silver: 500,\nGold: 1000, dll)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: Return config
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data rank tiers
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar rank tier\ndengan threshold masing-masing
Admin -> UI: Ubah threshold\n(Bronze: 100 → 150)
Admin -> UI: Klik "Simpan Threshold"
UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/rank-tiers\n{ Bronze: 150, Silver: 500, ... }
activate API
API -> Controller: updateRankTiers()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: updateRankThresholds(newThresholds)
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE SystemConfig SET\nconfig_value = '[newThresholds]'\nWHERE config_type = 'rank_thresholds'
activate DB
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
deactivate DB
Service ->> BackgroundJob: Trigger rekalkulasi rank\nsemua pengguna
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Rank threshold diupdate"
deactivate UI

== Exception: Transaction Rollback ==

note over DB
  Jika salah satu query gagal
  saat reset season:
  - ROLLBACK semua perubahan
  - Data tetap aman
  - Tampilkan error ke admin
end note

@enduml
